# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Repository-wide ignores.
#
# Each project also carries its own .gitignore. This file is the backstop for
# the things that are easy to leak from the repository root, and for the two
# categories the per-project files were found to miss: timestamped .env backups
# and packaged build artifacts.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Dependencies
node_modules/
.pnp
.pnp.js

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Secrets.
#
# The allow-listed *.example files are the documentation of what has to be set;
# everything else that looks like an environment file stays out.
#
# `.env.bak-*` is called out because it is what actually bit: the per-project
# ignores list `.env`, `.env.local` and `.env.*.local`, none of which match a
# file named `.env.bak-2026-07-27T07-50-55-182Z`. Two of those existed, each
# holding a live MongoDB URI with credentials, both JWT signing secrets, the
# seed admin password and the website revalidation secret.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.*.example
*.env.bak-*
.env.bak-*
bundle.env
!bundle.env.example

# Keys and certificates, in case one is ever dropped in a working tree
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
id_rsa*

# Build output
dist/
build/
.next/
out/
*.tsbuildinfo
next-env.d.ts

# Packaged release artifacts.
#
# `Portal/dist-portal/` is 124 MB across 12,354 files and `dist-portal.zip` is
# 51 MB — over GitHub's 50 MB per-file warning and reproducible from source with
# `npm run build:bundle`. Neither belongs in history, where it cannot be removed
# without a rewrite.
dist-portal/
dist-portal.zip
*.zip
*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.tgz

# Test and coverage
coverage/
.nyc_output/

# Logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*



# Editor and OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
*.swp
*~
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
!.vscode/settings.json

# Local tooling
.eslintcache
.turbo/
.vercel
